WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.901
-You guys, we are in the
second week of March Madness.

00:00:02.901 --> 00:00:03.767
-What?
-Yeah.

00:00:03.767 --> 00:00:05.067
And we're down to the Sweet 16.

00:00:05.067 --> 00:00:06.667
And every year, we pick a team
to root for,

00:00:06.667 --> 00:00:09.968
and this year we picked Gonzaga.

00:00:09.968 --> 00:00:12.334
And, well, unfortunately,
last night,

00:00:12.334 --> 00:00:15.000
they lost to the Arkansas
Razorbacks, who were great.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.067
[ Cheers and applause ]
It's a great team. Yeah.

00:00:18.067 --> 00:00:19.501
They're a good team.

00:00:19.501 --> 00:00:22.367
So, now I'd like to take a
minute and speak to my Bulldogs,

00:00:22.367 --> 00:00:24.133
because right now...

00:00:24.133 --> 00:00:27.000
I know you're probably feeling
pretty low.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:29.334
But let me tell you...

00:00:29.334 --> 00:00:30.334
you got a lot to be proud of.

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:34.434
Gonzaga...

00:00:34.434 --> 00:00:36.734
Gonzaga, you lost.

00:00:36.734 --> 00:00:39.000
But here's the good news.
You played well.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:40.300
You're a good team,

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:42.567
and hopefully someday
you're gonna go all the way.

00:00:42.567 --> 00:00:44.000
But look at the bright side.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:46.234
You still have spring break.

00:00:46.234 --> 00:00:49.400
Get out of Spokane
and go to Cancún.

00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:52.434
And you got those rowdy rags.
You already got your towel.

00:00:52.434 --> 00:00:54.234
We just wanted to say
that we're proud of you.

00:00:54.234 --> 00:00:55.834
You got to respect
how far you came.

00:00:55.834 --> 00:01:00.133
And besides, Sweet 16 is
a much cooler name than Elite 8.

00:01:00.133 --> 00:01:03.267
Who cares about being elite,
when you can be sweet?

00:01:03.267 --> 00:01:05.334
[ Laughter ]
Go, Zags.

00:01:05.334 --> 00:01:07.334
[ Cheers and applause ]
And, Timmy...

00:01:07.334 --> 00:01:09.400
time to shave that mustache.

00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:11.534
We'll be right back with more
"Tonight Show," everybody.

00:01:11.534 --> 00:01:17.300
♪♪

